ons. In addition, the company collects recyclable food and yard waste, as well as markets and sells mulch, compost, soil amendments, and renewable energy; offers remediation and construction, and industrial waste services; and manages and markets fly ash. Further, it provides Regulated Waste and Compliance Services (RWCS), which offers compliance programs, as well as collection, processing, and disposal of regulated and specialized waste, including medical, pharmaceutical, and hazardous waste; and Secure Information Destruction (SID) services that include the collection of personal and confidential information for secure destruction and recycling of sorted office paper. The company was formerly known as USA Waste Services, Inc. and changed its name to Waste Management, Inc. in 1998. Waste Management, Inc. was founded in 1968 and is based in Houston, Texas.","employees":60500,"website":"https://www.wm.com","country":"United States","city":"Houston","officers":[{"name":"Mr. James C. Fish Jr.","title":"CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. John J. Morris Jr.","title":"President"},{"name":"Mr. David L. Reed","title":"CFO & Executive VP"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":17.8,"tpe":26.24,"ps":2.167,"pfcf":27.37,"peg":1.44,"pb":3.607,"ev_ebitda":14.76,"rev_growth":0.118,"eps_growth":0.1755,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1584,"eps_growth_next":0.1445,"div_yield":0.0067,"roe":0.1475,"roa":0.05825,"de":67.05,"gross_margin":0.319,"op_margin":0.1262,"profit_margin":0.07405,"current_ratio":1.668},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":26.16,"sector":17.8,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":30.81,"sector":26.24,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":3.578,"sector":2.167,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":37.52,"sector":27.37,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":2.12,"sector":1.44,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":9.484,"sector":3.607,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Deb